include init.mod
variable up equal 6e-06
variable atomjiggle equal 1.0e-5
units metal
variable cfac equal 1.0e-4
variable cunits string GPa
variable etol equal 1.0e-8
variable ftol equal 1.0e-12
variable maxiter equal 0.0
variable maxeval equal 50000
variable dmax equal 1.0e-2
boundary p p p
read_data A0_7_minimized.data
Reading data file ...
  triclinic box = (0.022050465 0.023418443 0.019002339) to (17.57795 17.576582 17.580998) with tilt (1.0748212e-15 1.0753621e-15 1.0753621e-15)
  2 by 1 by 2 MPI processor grid
